        <name>next</name>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Remove and return the next item of work.</para><para>This is only called when <ref refid="classSawyer_1_1WorkFifo_1afc562579bfee99168982b1bf936b6169" kindref="member">isEmpty</ref> returns true.</para><para>This function is allowed to block to wait for other work to complete, which can be useful when the work list has more work to do but all that work depends on the completion of work that&apos;s already underway. Determining when the other work completes can be done by having the <ref refid="namespaceSawyer_1a1f34b997ec29ab29717d677098ff2b8c" kindref="member">processWorkList</ref> functor signal a condition variable on which this function is waiting. </para>        </detaileddescription>
